<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Chennai to Chandigarh | Safe Long-Distance Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a car transport from Chennai to Chandigarh typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 2,594 km via the NH 16 East Coast corridor usually requires 4‑5 business days under normal traffic conditions. Our dedicated GPS‑enabled fleet provides real‑time updates, and we factor in scheduled rest stops and any regional weather advisories to ensure timely delivery without compromising safety.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures guarantee zero scratches during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic ramp loading, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and wheel‑chock restraints on all our specialized carriers. Additionally, every vehicle undergoes a pre‑load inspection and is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, delivering a zero‑scratch guarantee from door to destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are mandatory for interstate car transport between Chennai and Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The essential paperwork includes the vehicle’s registration certificate, a valid insurance copy, an e‑Way bill generated for the freight, and a GST‑compliant invoice from Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers. These documents satisfy both state and central transport regulations, enabling smooth customs clearance and claim reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for Chennai‑to‑Chandigarh car shipping calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is derived from four primary factors: the total distance, the vehicle’s dimensions and weight, the selected service tier (standard, premium, or express), and any optional add‑ons such as extra insurance or specialized crating. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each element, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle live while it travels from Chennai to Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every carrier in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS tracking. Clients receive a secure link to monitor the exact location, speed, and estimated arrival time of their vehicle in real time, providing full visibility and peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for my car during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI, covering any accidental damage, theft, or loss that may occur during the move. The policy is automatically applied to every shipment, and a detailed claim process is outlined in the documentation package.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you handle vehicle loading and unloading for both two‑wheelers and four‑wheelers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet includes dedicated two‑wheeler carriers with custom wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings, as well as multi‑car trailers for four‑wheelers. Trained technicians perform hydraulic ramp loading and secure each vehicle with industry‑standard restraints, ensuring safe handling for all vehicle types.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
